  "notes": "Score the BEST response for Eye and Motor. A patient with E4 M0 B4 R4 may have locked-in syndrome — look for vertical eye movements / blink-to-command. Test one brainstem reflex battery consistently. FOUR predicts in-hospital mortality and poor outcome at least as well as GCS and better in intubated patients.",
